<title>GERMANY: Kloeckner owns 75 pct of Computer 2000.</title>
<headline>Kloeckner owns 75 pct of Computer 2000.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Computer 2000 AG said on Friday that Kloeckner &amp; Co, a unit of Viag AG, owned 75.03 percent of its ordinary stock.</p>
<p>Computer 2000 issued a statement, required under German stock exchange rules, after Kloeckner's stake rose above 75 percent.</p>
<p>Kloeckner acquired a majority holding in Computer 2000, a leading personal computer dealer, in 1994.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
